WEBVTT

00:09:00.268 --> 00:09:02.513
It was just a reminder
of how far we've come,

00:09:02.537 --> 00:09:05.061
and how much more
we still have left to do.

00:09:07.149 --> 00:09:09.974
"Overlooked" is including
other marginalized people as well.

00:09:09.998 --> 00:09:13.799
Recently, we had the obit
for the computer programmer Alan Turing.

00:09:14.157 --> 00:09:17.594
Believe it or not, this brilliant man
never got an obituary,

00:09:17.618 --> 00:09:18.824
even though his work

00:09:18.848 --> 00:09:21.625
decoding German messages
during World War II

00:09:21.649 --> 00:09:23.113
helps end the war.

00:09:24.356 --> 00:09:27.727
Instead, he died a criminal
for his sexual orientation,

00:09:27.751 --> 00:09:30.464
and he was forced to endure
chemical castration.